  "releaseNotes": "Added B-spline and NURBS curve types with point evaluation in normalized, knot, and arc-length coordinates, plus flattening, projection, distance, and contour support. Added exact point-intersection APIs between B-splines, NURBS curves, and all existing concrete curve types, including spline-to-spline combinations. All changes are additive and backward compatible with 1.1.0.",
